          "transfer": "<p>Choose the matching route. Write one task and one check before opening the example. There can be more than one useful answer.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Fresh source</th><th>Your task</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><code>L1-W-X</code></td><td>Jo will collect three comments after a Wednesday pilot. Rene will update the instructions. The continuation decision date is unset.</td><td>Choose a useful output and one source-based check.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>",
