          "transfer": "<p>For your route, write the sample you would use and identify its intended reader. Explain one detail you deliberately leave out.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Fresh source and agreed scope</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><code>L4-T-X</code></td><td>A maintainer asks for a fictional reproduction of an upload problem. The requirement is “PDF up to 2 MB.” Customer logs and credentials must not be included. No test has been run.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>",
