                "answer": "C",
                "feedback": "<p><strong>C retains the known task</strong> and asks a question that could resolve the missing deadline. <strong>A borrows the trial date</strong> for Mina&#x27;s separate commitment; the source does not make that connection. Keep her deadline unspecified. <strong>B removes a known owner</strong> because a date is missing. Restore Mina&#x27;s task and leave only the unsupported deadline open.</p>"
