                "answer": "B",
                "feedback": "<p><strong>B records the two changes</strong> while keeping the feedback attached to v1. <strong>A invents a new review</strong> from the presence of the corrections; record already addressed, not reviewed or approved. <strong>C overwrites the evidence</strong> of the original draft. Keep v1 identifiable and point to v2 for the changed status and limit. A real work record still follows its applicable retention and deletion rules.</p>"
